  "durationSeconds": 28.366667,
  "caption": "Moving to Spain taught me that there’s a huge difference between being alone and feeling lonely.\n\nI used to think that being surrounded by people automatically meant I was doing well. But some of the most peaceful moments of my life have been the ones where nobody else was around.\n\nGoing for dinner alone. Walking through a city without having somewhere to be. Sitting somewhere for an hour without needing to talk to anyone.\n\nI think learning to genuinely enjoy your own company changes the way you experience life.\n\nyoutube: tonitorichter\n\n#fypシ#viralvideo#beingalone#skillsdevelopment#hopecore",
  "transcript": {
    "text": "One of the best skills you could ever learn is to figure out how to be alone without feeling lonely at all. Without needing any validation, any attention from others. Without needing anything. The only person and the only thing you really need is you, is yourself. You need to grow finding peace. It's not easy, but you can absolutely do it and you can achieve this state of mind.",
